 ("docs/manuscript/METHODS.md", "593",
  "This interface does not require a finite SuSiE result for every gene.",
  "This interface does not require a finite SuSiE result for every gene. The Figure 1B overlap is computed on the 3,769 genes with a multi-signal COLOC result (SuSiE state positive or tested at PP.H4 ≤ 0.5); the 10,928 genes without one and the seven SuSiE-untestable genes are excluded rather than counted as negatives. The expected overlap is stratified by 10 AveExpr quantile bins (ties broken by Ensembl ID) and tested with the exact convolution of per-bin hypergeometric distributions (two-sided), with the Mantel-Haenszel OR and its Robins-Breslow-Greenland 95% CI (H57 prespecification)."),
